                        "review": "This is a wonderfull visual detective novel suitable for younger gamers.  The mysteries involve simple things from finding out who stole a cookie to who stole the Golden Sneeze from the museum.\nLight hearted and funny mysteries that can be played through in a single evening. \nI had a lot of fun playing this with my nephew and watching him solve the mysteries. Made babysitting the kid really enjoyable.",
